{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- add current-main Nubia P0110 no-Host AudioTrack smoke evidence for the Android playback adapter\n- update the P0110 audio owner record and README audio row to point at the 2026-09-08 evidence package\n- retain a fail-closed android-audio-playback owner summary with can_close_android_audio_playback_gate=false\n\n## Verification\n- ANDROID_SERIAL=<redacted-adb-serial> ./gradlew --no-daemon connectedDebugAndroidTest -Pandroid.testInstrumentationRunnerArguments.class=dev.telemachus.display.audio.ProtocolPcmAudioPlayerInstrumentedTest\n- ./gradlew --no-daemon testDebugUnitTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.audio.ProtocolPcmAudioPlaybackTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.audio.ProtocolPcmAudioStreamTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.StreamClientProtocolV1IntegrationTest.usbLanPcmFixtureNegotiatesWritesAndCleansUpOnDisconnect --tests dev.telemachus.display.StreamClientProtocolV1IntegrationTest.rejectedAudioReconfigurationStopsExistingPlayback --tests dev.telemachus.display.StreamClientProtocolV1IntegrationTest.malformedAudioPacketAfterAcceptedConfigFailsSessionAndReleasesOutput\n- make android-audio-playback-owner-record EVIDENCE_DIR=docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main\n- shasum -a 256 -c docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/SHA256SUMS\n- local Markdown link check for README/TEST/evidence README\n- privacy scan for raw P0110 serial and local absolute paths\n- make phase0-stable-release-gate PHASE0_STABLE_RELEASE_EXPECTED_SOURCE_COMMIT=7284cecf4243e21b263f997c937bec5ddcefc006 (can_mark_phase0_stable_release=false; source_guard remains insufficient because the aggregate manifest is still bound to the prior current-main refresh)\n\n## Boundaries\n- no MacHost/Vibe Screen/Telemachus GUI launched\n- no swift run\n- no macOS TCC/Screen Recording/Accessibility/Microphone/Keychain/System Settings changes\n- no adb reverse tcp:54321 tcp:54321 mapping created\n- does not close real USB/LAN audio playback, Android/macOS clipboard E2E, Android/macOS file-transfer E2E, or Phase 0 stable-release gates","closedAt":"2026-09-08T01:40:55Z","files":[{"path":"README.md","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/TEST.md","additions":22,"deletions":13,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/README.md","additions":119,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/SHA256SUMS","additions":32,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/android-audio-playback-observations.json","additions":55,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/android-audio-playback-summary.json","additions":239,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/android-test-report/css/base-style.css","additions":162,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/android-test-report/css/style.css","additions":86,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-p0110-audio-current-base/evidence/2026-09-08-p0110-audio-android-track-no-host-current-main/android-test-report/dev.telemachus.display.audio.ProtocolPcmAudioPlayerInstrumentedTest.html","additions":87,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-24-